  "name": "banana-vidorev3-synthetic-arms",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tBanana ViDoRe v3 Synthetic Arms\n\t\n\nDomain-separated ViDoRe v3 synthetic training arms for finance and industrial adaptation.\nThe Hub dataset uses finance and industrial as dataset configs/subsets. Within each config, splits separate\nvlm_in_batch, vlm_ocr_bm25, banana_fullpipe, and hybrid_vlm_ocr_bm25_banana_fullpipe.\nGenerated at: 2026-06-29T11:49:45.670912+00:00\nTotal JSONL rows across configs/splits: 151691.\nImages are stored once per subset under\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/vkehfdl1/banana-vidorev3-synthetic-arms.",
